WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.222
The best way to learn these systems is to run something small, change one factor, and observe what happens.

00:00:07.222 --> 00:00:14.002
When a result changes, ask what caused the change and whether it actually improved the task.

00:00:14.002 --> 00:00:18.367
That habit is more useful than memorizing terminology.

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:26.402
For example, if you raise temperature and the answer changes, do not stop at “it became more creative.” Look at what

00:00:26.402 --> 00:00:31.765
happened to the token probabilities and whether that change helped the task.
